## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates practical memory management skills in NUMA environments, testing understanding of memory locality, fragmentation control, and efficient cross-node synchronization mechanisms.

## Key Concepts
- NUMA locality optimization through per-node memory pools
- Slab allocator architecture with thread-local caching
- Cross-node free list management and bulk reclamation
- Memory alignment requirements and fragmentation mitigation

## Code Example
